Shebeke: Digital Glass

Copyright (c) 2026, project author.

This repository contains an interactive digital-art implementation of a
shebeke-inspired visual system. Some visual elements and references were
adapted from material found on OpenProcessing. The exact original sketch URL
and author were not preserved in the local context file, so this repository
does not claim those adapted portions as original work.

Permission to view and run the demonstration is granted. Reuse, redistribution,
adaptation, publication, or inclusion in another project requires prior notice
to and contact with the project author.

Before reusing or redistributing this project or any adapted visual material,
contact the project author and verify the original OpenProcessing author,
source URL, and applicable license. Reuse must include the required notices
and attribution once that source information has been confirmed.

The bundled audio track may be subject to separate rights. Do not redistribute
or reuse the audio without confirming the rights of its respective author or
rights holder.
